<h4 id="lemma-hackathon">Lemma Hackathon</h4>

<p>Come join us for a one-day working session where students and postdocs (ideally 10 to 15) each bring one research problem and use <a href="https://axiomatic.ai/lemma/">Lemma</a>, a web platform for planning, running and writing up research with an AI agent, to take it from a question to a written-up result. A scientist from <a href="https://axiomatic.ai">Axiomatic AI</a> is in the room or on call for questions the room cannot answer. You bring the problems. We bring the tool, the structure, and access for the day.</p>

<p>This hackathon is primarily intended for PhD students and postdocs in the physical sciences, mathematics and engineering. The day works best for people who already know a problem well enough to judge whether an answer is right. Below is a tentative schedule for the day.</p>

